t: positive (favorable explanation and reassurance)\\n- Follow-up needed: no (concern addressed, candidate satisfied)\\n- Serious concern reported: no (policy explanation, not an unreported concern)\\n- Testimonial potential: yes (concrete positive example with clear context)\\n\\n**DEV-054**: Intrusive pregnancy question with no stated occupational context. Candidate requests explanation.\\n- Sentiment: negative (inappropriate question)\\n- Follow-up needed: yes (explicit request for explanation)\\n- Serious concern reported: yes (intrusive pregnancy question without accommodation/occupational health context)\\n- Testimonial potential: no\\n\\n**DEV-055**: Optional race-monitoring form, stated separation from panel decision, candidate completed interview.\\n- Sentiment: neutral (factual description of appropriate process)\\n- Follow-up needed: no (no unresolved issues)\\n- Serious concern reported: no (stated optional monitoring kept separate from selection)\\n- Testimonial potential: no\\n\\n**DEV-056**: Second-hand report of interviewer message excluding people with epilepsy. Candidate requests investigation.\\n- Sentiment: negative (disability-based exclusion)\\n- Follow-up needed: yes (explicit request to investigate)\\n- Serious concern reported: yes (specific second-hand allegation of disability discrimination)\\n- Testimonial potential: no\\n\\n**DEV-057**: Rejected after stating inability to work advertised shift. Candidate understands decision, no complaint.\\n- Sentiment: neutral (job-related rejection accepted by candidate)\\n- Follow-up needed: no (no outstanding issue, candidate satisfied)\\n- Serious concern reported: no (job-related decision, no discriminatory treatment reported)\\n- Testimonial potential: no\\n\\n**DEV-058**: Good interview, but application sent to outside mailing list without consent. Support confirmed deletion and fixed issue. Candidate satisfied.\\n- Sentiment: mixed (praise + privacy breach, though remedied)\\n- Follow-up needed: no (remedy explicitly complete, candidate satisfied)\\n- Serious concern reported: yes (privacy exposure to unintended recipient—remedy does not erase the report)\\n- Testimonial potential: no\\n\\n**DEV-059**: Positive about staff, but manager repeatedly asked candidate out after two explicit rejections. Candidate asked recruiter to stop contact.\\n- Sentiment: mixed (praise + unwanted repeated sexual conduct)\\n- Follow-up needed: yes (open request to stop manager contact)\\n- Serious concern reported: yes (repeated unwanted sexual conduct after explicit rejection)\\n- Testimonial potential: no\\n\\n**DEV-060**: Rejected candidate suspects discrimination but lacks specifics. Requests decision review.\\n- Sentiment: negative (rejection with expressed concern)\\n- Follow-up needed: yes (explicit request to check decision)\\n- Serious concern reported: insufficient_information (suspicion without supporting detail)\\n- Testimonial potential: no\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"context_management\":null,\"diagnostics\":null,\"id\":\"msg_011CfVevZLxJFTq8TrwYfV64\",\"input_transformations\":[],\"model\":\"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"stop_details\":null,\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"type\":\"message\",\"usage\":{\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0},\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":0,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":0,\"inference_geo\":\"not_available\",\"input_tokens\":3365,\"output_tokens\":1,\"service_tier\":\"standard\"}},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"request_id\":\"req_011CfVevYwPc5LH318cTjp62\",\"session_id\":\"aa3dae4e-4950-4fcb-a058-073d07ad1708\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-28T10:09:57.962Z\",\"type\":\"assistant\",\"uuid\":\"ad10f0fc-693a-4558-ac05-7b62817bed78\"},{\"message\":{\"container\":null,\"content\":[{\"caller\":{\"type\":\"direct\"},\"id\":\"toolu_01TKBZHVzkVkGMKRzDym7Jvn\",\"input\":{\"records\":[{\"follow_up_needed\":\"yes\",\"id\":\"DEV-051\",\"sentiment\":\"negative\",\"serious_